<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Pizol Five Lakes hike — Pizolhütte – five lakes – Gaffia</name><desc>From Pizolhütte, follow the marked five-lake mountain route past Wildsee, Schottensee, Schwarzsee and Baschalvasee to Gaffia. Expect strenuous climbs, loose stones and rough descents, and arrive before the last chairlift.

